<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Benchmark Examples</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Listings <a href="#LST1" title="Listing 1 ‣ Appendix F Example Model Outputs ‣ Language Model as Planner and Formalizer under Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> and <a href="#LST2" title="Listing 2 ‣ Appendix F Example Model Outputs ‣ Language Model as Planner and Formalizer under Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> display a benchmark example of BlocksWorld from <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib40" title="" class="ltx_ref">Valmeekam et al. (2024a)</a></cite> and <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib14" title="" class="ltx_ref">Huang and Zhang (2025)</a></cite>. Listings <a href="#LST3" title="Listing 3 ‣ Appendix F Example Model Outputs ‣ Language Model as Planner and Formalizer under Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> and <a href="#LST4" title="Listing 4 ‣ Appendix F Example Model Outputs ‣ Language Model as Planner and Formalizer under Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> display an example of the Logistics domain from <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib14" title="" class="ltx_ref">Huang and Zhang (2025)</a></cite>. Language seen in this benchmark is simplistic and not not realistic to the real world.</p>
</div>
